sta per essere catturato da Naruto e il suo team quando convoca il potere delle Linee Temporali – un antico canale sotterraneo del chakra. Naruto viene imprigionato dal chakra e rispedito indietro nel tempo nella città di Loran, conosciuta per le sue mille torri. Lì incontra il futuro Quarto Hokage, Minato Namikaze, in una missione top-secret e la Regina di Loran, Sara, il cui governo è minacciato da Mukade. Riuscirà Naruto a tornare nel suo tempo e può un incontro casuale nel passato salvare il futuro?","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2010-07-31","status":"Released","rating":7.167,"ratingCount":526,"genres":["Avventura","Azione","Animazione"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"85m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":82055,"name":"Junko Takeuchi","role":"Naruto Uzumaki (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNjrblq3xS1idpCsmSl5P5eTon7.jpg"},{"id":89968,"name":"Kazuhiko Inoue","role":"Kakashi Hatake (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3BpYtYRiLAmTNbCm2LXlXnkMRit.jpg"},{"id":9706,"name":"Toshiyuki Morikawa","role":"Minato Namikaze (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hrzGBe4nokgkBNFekNo5hlXB2Bv.jpg"},{"id":82057,"name":"Chie Nakamura","role":"Sakura Haruno (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/evB6vKUbm0CKgBcgikPeFXdwd29.jpg"},{"id":224413,"name":"Satoshi Hino","role":"Sai (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg"},{"id":237076,"name":"Rikiya Koyama","role":"Yamato (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hsZm87BORLpzhaycBaWOD5xpjVC.jpg"},{"id":1242034,"name":"Nobuaki Fukuda","role":"Chôza Akimichi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e9hPaaWAgvzThEcvRR3YamNKdrh.jpg"},{"id":1247847,"name":"Kenji Hamada","role":"Shibi Aburame (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/27bujo3KlawFgrFOO2nnlDgxXsE.jpg"},{"id":934837,"name":"Keiko Nemoto","role":"Shizune (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xaWKZMr93brbPKMCjz1LT8WIgt4.jpg"},{"id":221773,"name":"Saori Hayami","role":"Sâra (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gLv9lO7dlUbIsmyJUvgegqAAXki.jpg"},{"id":81858,"name":"Yumi Touma","role":"Sêramu (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4R0uvJ5d4deDQEEzRGgLzXlMuKm.jpg"},{"id":552600,"name":"Yuko Kobayashi","role":"Masakô (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Dq7JUi9x1kVwCf6l056Ji26nPN.jpg"},{"id":1241658,"name":"Fujiko Takimoto","role":"Sarai / Young Asuma (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j2xu3xPRw2yITNvpAL2XICC6PUL.jpg"},{"id":1253972,"name":"Mutsumi Tamura","role":"Young Kakashi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uvbBIRiBK6GDLEESiYSFWOVlaE4.jpg"},{"id":1254054,"name":"Mayuki Makiguchi","role":"Young Guy (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u9ankcyRGXNRqBxijqp5CbXyUOu.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Naruto Shippuden: Il film - La torre perduta","overview":"Il Ninja malvagio Mukade sta per essere catturato da Naruto e il suo team quando convoca il potere delle Linee Temporali – un antico canale sotterraneo del chakra. Naruto viene imprigionato dal chakra e rispedito indietro nel tempo nella città di Loran, conosciuta per le sue mille torri. Lì incontra il futuro Quarto Hokage, Minato Namikaze, in una missione top-secret e la Regina di Loran, Sara, il cui governo è minacciato da Mukade. Riuscirà Naruto a tornare nel suo tempo e può un incontro casuale nel passato salvare il futuro?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Naruto Shippuden the Movie: The Lost Tower","overview":"Assigned on a mission to capture Mukade, a missing-nin, Naruto Uzumaki sets out for the once glorious historic ruins of \"Ouran\", where he pursues and corners the rouge ninja. Mukade's goal is revealed to be a dormant leyline within the ruins; he unleashes the power of the leyline, causing a light to envelop Naruto, sending him into the past, 20 years before the series began. When Naruto awakens, he comes into contact with the Fourth Hokage, Minato Namikaze."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"抜け忍ムカデ追跡任務を受け、砂隠れの廃墟・楼蘭へと向かったナルト。追い詰められたムカデは、廃墟に眠る龍脈の力を解放し、ナルトは過去の世界へ飛ばされてしまう!突如襲来する謎の傀儡集団!!そのときナルトを救ったのは、若き日の四代目火影・波風ミナトだった。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nxX0krYEzLuDrnZistEAjosPYXG.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nxX0krYEzLuDrnZistEAjosPYXG.png","language":"it","width":2409,"height":1766},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5JS4KhtQlVIvKxwUfqw9ctvHfW.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5JS4KhtQlVIvKxwUfqw9ctvHfW.png","language":"en","width":969,"height":531},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/elFJ2gel8EIgAGuHaLtM3miNNVx.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/elFJ2gel8EIgAGuHaLtM3miNNVx.png","language":"ja","width":729,"height":530}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mtyIBwILaTGEqNAtogxXqA1QJlS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mtyIBwILaTGEqNAtogxXqA1QJlS.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yXgmhQYWKpcy3Ts0dIHDnU69Srm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yXgmhQYWKpcy3Ts0dIHDnU69Srm.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6e2YvN1tQK4xQHlmy7GJTuXOt2u.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6e2YvN1tQK4xQHlmy7GJTuXOt2u.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9O5tcb7bcIUjgUG24nnlCPMBFHd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9O5tcb7bcIUjgUG24nnlCPMBFHd.jpg","language":"en","width":1600,"height":2400},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jCDNRKHUEPLPzdilMmh7xX8pMB8.jpg","previewUrl":"htt